Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 17:03:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add automatic Bluetooth and Wi-Fi switching to the top bar
 design

Two icons in the top bar show the link in use (blue, glowing) or offline (grey).
Automatic mode prefers Bluetooth and falls back to Wi-Fi. Manual menu: Automatic,
Bluetooth only, Wi-Fi only. Demo control panel gains range tick boxes. FR-11 and
UC-4 checks updated. New SRS change 11. Link colour tokens added to palette.
